240:                             + target.getAbsolutePath()
241:                             + "} exists but failed to clean it up");
242:         } else if (!target.mkdirs()) {
243:             throw new IOException("Failed to create target directory: " + target.getAbsolutePath());
244:         }
245:         return target;
246:     }
